{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/DOTFFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets\/simple"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration suitable for face verification use cases."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The component operates without any visual aids or guidance for the user, with the exception of the detection layer (tracking circle)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"There is no automatic triggering of the capture process."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Instead, the client is responsible for initiating the capture by explicitly calling the "},{"type":"text","text":"requestCapture"},{"type":"text","text":" method."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This configuration provides a minimalistic approach, offering flexibility to the client in managing the capture timing and user interaction,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is often desired in verification scenarios."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/dotfacecore\/dotffaceautocaptureconfigurationpresets\/simple"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore","doc:\/\/DotFaceCore\/documentation\/DotFaceCore\/DOTFFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets"]]},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"DotFaceCore"}],"title":"simple","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"simple","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Type Property","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"simple","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@M@DotFaceCore@objc(cs)DOTFFaceAutoCaptureConfigurationPresets(cpy)simple","symbolKind":"property"},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@property","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":